      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Sign in to Dreamina in **ComfyUI menu → Extensions → Dreamina → Dreamina Settings**.\n2. In **Script**, write what the host says.\n3. Press **Run**. The voice is saved under `audio/dreamina`."
      ],
      "title": "Start Here"
    },
