          }
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Seed Audio reads **Script** aloud in the voice that `voice-name` names: here `Good Guy`. `arguments` holds the model's own settings, written by the names Dreamina gives them. With nothing connected, the node uses text reading, Seed Audio's way to read a script in a chosen voice.\n\nConnect a picture instead, and Seed Audio makes a voice that suits it, as **audio-02-give-a-host-a-voice** does."
      ],
      "title": "Note"
    },
